# Your own scenarios. Write as many as you like, then run:
#     make add-scenarios FILE=examples/my-scenarios.brain
#
# Rules:
#   - each scenario starts with a `scenario:` line
#   - then one task per line, same format as examples/sample.brain
#   - at least 2 open tasks per scenario, or it is skipped
#   - "today" is always Monday 23 Nov 2026, so `due kal` means Tue 24th
#
# Modifiers after the title, separated by | :
#   tiny | small | medium | large | xlarge     effort
#   due <anything>     aaj, kal, parso, 15 tarikh, next monday, in 3 days, 15/12
#   goal <title>       must match a `goal:` line in the same scenario
#   after <title>      that task must finish first
#   done               already finished

scenario: Hotfix versus the flights
Ship the hotfix           | medium | due aaj
Book flights for Diwali   | small  | due in 2 days
Call Amma                 | tiny

scenario: Everything waits on the client
goal: Ship the client site
Ask client for brand assets | tiny
Design the homepage         | large | after Ask client for brand assets | goal Ship the client site
Build the components        | large | after Design the homepage | goal Ship the client site
Invoice the client          | tiny  | due 15 tarikh
